# GitHub remote

The canonical repository is https://github.com/DanielOilema/gestao_compra.git (`origin`).

- Commit in this local repo and push to `origin` (GitHub). Do not create another GitHub repo or use Cursor Origin (`origin.cursor.com`).
- When the user asks to commit (or "commit no GitHub"), commit here and push the current branch to `origin`.
- Keep `origin` pointing at `https://github.com/DanielOilema/gestao_compra.git`. Do not change remotes unless the user asks.
